# Generated dictionary data (rebuild with: node scripts/build-dict.mjs)
# Generated rather than committed: cmudict.dict is 3.5 MB and the packed form is
# 2.09 MB, which would dominate the repository. It lives under public/ so WXT
# copies it verbatim into the package, which means the shipped extension bundles
# the data and there is no runtime download (spec 5.2).
public/dict/
.cache/

